    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em><strong>Curse-Breaking required.</strong></em> It is impossible for anyone to magically detect the act of you successfully breaking a curse, removing an enchantment, or taking down a ward. If someone sees you curse-breaking or is actively looking for the removed magic, they will notice the magic's absence. If a spell is designed to notify the caster in some way, it no longer works and the caster will not be notified.</p>",
